      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Looking through the ContactManager in the VRCSDK, it appears that there can only be 4096 receivers active in a scene. It's pretty unlikely this is the issue though, since you'd need a full instance of 80 people ALL with 50 receivers active at the same time.\n\nNothing else stands out as an obvious limit, unless the in-game implementation is different from the one in the vrcsdk.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
